---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import SbP05ExDateCalculatorDemo from '../demos/SbP05ExDateCalculatorDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="sbp5d-figure">
  <DemoFrame
    title="Interactive: calculate Vietnamese ex-date (GDKHQ) reference price, dividend tax, and rights cash call"
    titleVi="Tương tác: tính giá tham chiếu ngày GDKHQ, thuế cổ tức 5% và tiền nộp quyền mua"
  >
    <div class="sbp5d-fallback">
      <span data-lang-en>
        Without JavaScript: holding 1,000 HOSE shares closing at 30,000 VND with a 20% cash dividend (2,000 VND/share) and 20% stock dividend adjusts the Ex-Date reference price to (30,000 − 2,000) ÷ 1.2 = 23,350 VND (ceiling 24,950 / floor 21,750). You receive 1,900,000 VND net cash (after 5% PIT) plus 200 waiting shares.
      </span>
      <span data-lang-vi>
        Không cần JavaScript: nắm 1.000 CP HOSE đóng cửa 30.000 đồng khi chia cổ tức 20% tiền mặt (2.000 đ/CP) và 20% cổ phiếu sẽ điều chỉnh giá tham chiếu ngày GDKHQ thành (30.000 − 2.000) ÷ 1,2 = 23.350 đồng (trần 24.950 / sàn 21.750). Bạn nhận 1.900.000 đồng ròng sau thuế 5% và 200 CP chờ về.
      </span>
    </div>
    <SbP05ExDateCalculatorDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Try selecting "2:1 rights @ 10k" to see why skipping a discounted rights issue wipes wealth on Ex-Date morning unless you subscribe, transfer the right, or sell before GDKHQ.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bấm thử nút "Quyền mua 2:1 giá 10k" để thấy vì sao quên nộp tiền mua quyền giá ưu đãi sẽ làm bạn mất tiền ngay sáng ngày GDKHQ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .sbp5d-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp5d-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .sbp5d-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }

  .sbp5d-fallback {
    margin: 2px 0 0; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px dashed var(--border); border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .sbp5d-fallback:has(~ astro-island:defined) { display: none; }

  .sbp5d-sliders { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .sbp5d-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; }
  .sbp5d-lbl { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp5d-val { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp5d-range { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--btn-primary-bg); cursor: pointer; margin: 4px 0 0; }
  .sbp5d .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(175px, 1fr)); margin-top: 12px; }
  .sbp5d .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .sbp5d .sd-stat b { font-size: 15.5px; }
  .sbp5d-note { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
</style>
